{"error": false, "page": 9, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 9, "recordCount": 803, "data": [{"docid2": 1071597, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "媒体报道", "chnldocurl": "http://smrb.smnet.com.cn/shtml/smrb/20180108/139818.shtml", "content": "", "docabstract": "上月29日，在泰宁县城西规划新区张家坊万有窠，车辆、机械的轰鸣声打破了往日的寂静，当日，总投资约3.83亿元的泰宁县总医院项目正式开工建设。", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smrb.smnet.com.cn/shtml/smrb/20180108/139818.shtml", "docreltime": "2018.01.09 09:20:00", "doctitle": "泰宁县总医院开工建设（三明日报）", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1118892, "sourcename": "三明市卫计委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "http://smrb.smnet.com.cn/shtml/smrb/20180108/139818.shtml", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1064953, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "媒体报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.cn-healthcare.com/article/20180104/content-498951.html?appfrom=jkj&from=singlemessage", "content": "", "docabstract": "医保支付是基本医保管理和深化医改的重要环节，是调节医疗服务行为、引导医疗资源配置的杠杆之一。近日，多地医院曝出年底严控医疗费用、停用部分医用耗材的消息，很快在网上引发争议", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.cn-healthcare.com/article/20180104/content-498951.html?appfrom=jkj&from=singlemessage", "docreltime": "2018.01.05 08:36:00", "doctitle": "2017医改年终考 | 按病种付费助推医保支付改革（健康界）", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1111863, "sourcename": "三明市卫计委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "http://www.cn-healthcare.com/article/20180104/content-498951.html?appfrom=jkj&from=singlemessage", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1064972, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "媒体报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shyywstzgg/mtbd/201801/t20180105_1064972.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步培育和践行社会主义核心价值观，引导和激励全省干部群众为建设新福建奋斗，由省委宣传部主办，相关省直单位协办的2017年度福建省践行社会主义核心价值观基层“最美人物”发布会29日举行。\n　　此次评选", "docabstract": "清流县医院倪筱蓉获评“最美医生”称号", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "doc